## Verification limits

The restored web game and an Android debug build were exercised in this cloud environment. The eight real-game checks, all 91 pickups, five remaining hearts and final score of 2,240 were verified. A physical Android performance or sustained gameplay test was unavailable. `Verification/` records exactly which checks ran. Content that existed only on a disconnected device, in an unsaved editor buffer or in an unavailable private service cannot be certified by this export.
